  "id": "ctd",
  "term": "CTD",
  "definition": "CTD stands for critical thinking disposition, meaning a person’s tendency to engage with complex problems in an open-minded, reflective, and evidence-sensitive way. It describes a motivational and cognitive readiness to think critically rather than a specific skill itself.",
